From 2eeb9993b4494cbe8736d885a6bc79f9c79f4864 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sleepy <sleepy@example.com>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 12:36:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 15/16] drm/amdgpu: fix NULL pointer dereference in
 amdgpu_vm_init error path

Reorder the error path (dri-devel ML 591316, 08-25): free the root page
table after unreserving the root BO, so amdgpu_vm_pt_free_root() does not
touch a still-reserved (and possibly NULL) root.bo.

ML WIP (08-25) - isolated commit, easy to drop when it lands upstream.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/amd/amdgpu/amdgpu_vm.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/amdgpu/amdgpu_vm.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/amdgpu/amdgpu_vm.c
index 15f39ca683d9..600315acd0df 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/amdgpu/amdgpu_vm.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/amdgpu/amdgpu_vm.c
@@ -2736,8 +2736,8 @@ int amdgpu_vm_init(struct amdgpu_device *adev, struct amdgpu_vm *vm,
 	return 0;
 
 error_free_root:
-	amdgpu_vm_pt_free_root(adev, vm);
 	amdgpu_bo_unreserve(vm->root.bo);
+	amdgpu_vm_pt_free_root(adev, vm);
 	amdgpu_bo_unref(&root_bo);
 
 error_free_delayed:
